    <!-- Replaces expenses_mom_paid/expenses_dad_paid. The call site (ExpenseSummaryHeader's
         who-paid row) needs both the payer's name and the amount in one Text; the name serves
         as its own label, so nothing has to agree with it. "von %1$s" was dropped: parentLabel's
         fallbacks include pronouns/common nouns ("dir", "Mitelternteil") that "von" would then
         govern the case or article of ("von dir", "vom Mitelternteil"), reintroducing the exact
         problem this key exists to avoid. %1$s is the payer's name, %2$s is the formatted
         amount. -->
